  - m_Id: 25173604225024
    m_Localized: Please read these terms and conditions carefully before using Our
      Service.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27014354227200
    m_Localized: Interpretation and Definitions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28161638977536
    m_Localized: Interpretation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28515575320576
    m_Localized: The words of which the initial letter is capitalized have meanings
      defined under the following conditions. The following definitions shall have
      the same meaning regardless of whether they appear in singular or in plural.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28728805347328
    m_Localized: Definitions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28944136720384
    m_Localized: 'For the purposes of these Terms and Conditions:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43022611697664
    m_Localized: Application
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43201700089856
    m_Localized: Application means the software program provided by the Company downloaded
      by You on any electronic device, named Filar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43451110182912
    m_Localized: 'Application Store '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43698783834112
    m_Localized: Application Store means the digital distribution service operated
      and developed by Apple Inc. (Apple App Store) or Google Inc. (Google Play Store)
      in which the Application has been downloaded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63661905072128
    m_Localized: Affiliate means an entity that controls, is controlled by or is
      under common control with a party, where "control" means ownership of 50% or
      more of the shares, equity interest or other securities entitled to vote for
      election of directors or other managing authority.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63294500818944
    m_Localized: Affiliate
